# supercronic schedule (container TZ via env). Fields: m h dom mon dow  command
#
# Hourly: pull every FortiGate config and snapshot to Wasabi via restic.
0 * * * *     fgbackup run
#
# Daily 02:30: apply retention (cheap; only drops snapshot references).
30 2 * * *    fgbackup forget
#
# Quarterly (1st of Jan/Apr/Jul/Oct, 03:00): actually delete/repack + verify.
# Spaced so pruned pack files have aged past Wasabi's 90-day minimum storage.
0 3 1 */3 *   fgbackup prune && fgbackup check
